    {
      "id": "term-eng-t62",
      "termNumber": "62",
      "engSourceId": "eng-t62-v1",
      "title": "heal",
      "sourceFile": "eng/json/008.content.json",
      "selectedBy": "passage",
      "text": {
        "status": "source",
        "sourceId": "eng-t62-v1",
        "html": "<p>In this kind of healing, Jesus <b>heals</b> the person both physically and spiritually, restoring him or her to community. The person has been made whole or complete.</p>",
